      '12 of 50 written 12 slash 50 means this is impression number twelve out of a total edition of fifty it does not indicate the order the impressions were printed and it does not mean number 12 is better or worse or more valuable than number 40 all impressions in the edition are meant to be equivalent',
      'once the stated number plus any artist proofs is printed the edition is closed and the plate is traditionally defaced cancelled or scored so no more can be pulled an open edition has no fixed limit',
